Lab Dropbear ed25519 host key (NOT for production).

dropbear_ed25519_host_key is staged onto the ESP/PXE root as
/etc/ssh/dropbear_ed25519_host_key so the fingerprint stays stable across
rebuilds/boots. Clients that already pinned an auto-generated key will need
one known_hosts cleanup (or StrictHostKeyChecking=accept-new).

Fingerprint (SHA256): VlA3XoW9Nn/Nh2zrTHk93mOJvKPuBZ3qKAdq1RpHxVQ

Override at stage time:
  METAL_SSHD_HOSTKEY=/path/to/dropbear_ed25519_host_key ./scripts/run efi
If unset, the checked-in key above is used.

Guest path override (runtime): sshd.json "host_key".
